OL,3,GNEWSATeam 'heartbroken' after player
OL,4,Aand father stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club said its young players
OL,7,Fhad been left "heartbroken" by the
OL,8,F"devastating circumstances" after one
OL,9,Fof their teammates and his father were
OL,10,Fstabbed by intruders at their home in
OL,11,FLeicestershire.
OL,13,FImrane Chelirem, 15, and his father
OL,14,FMohamed were named locally as the
OL,15,Fvictims of the attack at the hands of
OL,16,Ftwo masked men in Thurnby shortly
OL,17,Fbefore 00:30 BST on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
